OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWindy and
OL,6,Fcloudy. Rain focused across far west
OL,7,Fearly evening, spreading to the rest
OL,8,Fof the area overnight, perhaps turning
OL,9,Fheavy at times and to snow over west
OL,10,Fhills.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,13,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,14,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,15,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,16,Foutbreaks focused over the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
