OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers throughout across most areas,
OL,7,Fbut always drier and brighter towards
OL,8,FDeeside. Temperatures seasonally low
OL,9,Fgiven the generally northerly winds.
